@startuml
title UML state machine diagram for Online Quiz System

state "Unregistered User" as UnregisteredUser
UnregisteredUser : entry/No Account
UnregisteredUser : do/Register or Login
UnregisteredUser : exit/User Logged In

state "Logged In User" as LoggedInUser
LoggedInUser : entry/User Logged In
LoggedInUser : do/Login as Teacher or Student
LoggedInUser : exit/Teacher Home
LoggedInUser : exit/Student Home

state "Teacher Home" as TeacherHome
TeacherHome : entry/Teacher Logged In
TeacherHome : do/Create Quiz
TeacherHome : do/Edit Quiz
TeacherHome : do/Save Draft
TeacherHome : do/Publish Quiz
TeacherHome : do/View Results
TeacherHome : exit/Logged Out

state "Student Home" as StudentHome
StudentHome : entry/Student Logged In
StudentHome : do/Select Quiz
StudentHome : do/Answer Quiz
StudentHome : do/Submit Quiz
StudentHome : do/View Result
StudentHome : exit/Logged Out

state "Quiz Creation" as QuizCreation
QuizCreation : entry/New Quiz Created
QuizCreation : do/Add Questions
QuizCreation : do/Edit Questions
QuizCreation : do/Save Draft
QuizCreation : do/Publish
QuizCreation : exit/Draft Saved
QuizCreation : exit/Published

state "Quiz Editing" as QuizEditing
QuizEditing : entry/Existing Quiz Edited
QuizEditing : do/Add Questions
QuizEditing : do/Edit Questions
QuizEditing : do/Save Changes
QuizEditing : exit/Changes Saved

state "View Results" as ViewResults
ViewResults : entry/Quiz Over
ViewResults : do/Review Results
ViewResults : exit/Logged Out

state "Answering Quiz" as AnsweringQuiz
AnsweringQuiz : entry/Selected Quiz
AnsweringQuiz : do/Answer Questions
AnsweringQuiz : do/Submitted
AnsweringQuiz : exit/Result Viewed

[*] --> UnregisteredUser
UnregisteredUser --> LoggedInUser : Register or Login

LoggedInUser --> TeacherHome : Login as Teacher
LoggedInUser --> StudentHome : Login as Student

TeacherHome --> QuizCreation : Create New Quiz
TeacherHome --> QuizEditing : Edit Existing Quiz
QuizCreation --> QuizEditing : Save Draft / Publish
QuizEditing --> QuizCreation : Save Changes
QuizEditing --> TeacherHome : Exit Editing

StudentHome --> AnsweringQuiz : Select and Start Quiz
AnsweringQuiz --> ViewResults : Submit Quiz
ViewResults --> StudentHome : Exit Viewing Results

@enduml
